Z||000015||filthyscarecrow||08-05-2001||11:08 PM||||i have a set on my car. people jump at crosswalks when i honk at them (people here have no fokking clue what the little red hand means. this is why i believe in evolution- the only thing keeping me from hitting them is having to buy a new front fascia). they're metal horns, sound a lot liek the ones they put on older ferraris, and they're like 135dB. the trick is to aim them straight down. the sound bounces up and around the car. poeple can even hear me on the highway. just make sure theyre metal horns...||||reg||1
